UnitMetarouter::Execute
├── when reached through delegatecall
│   └── it should revert with DirectCallRequired
└── given reached through a direct call
    ├── when the commands outnumber the inputs
    │   └── it should revert with LengthMismatch
    ├── when the inputs outnumber the commands
    │   └── it should revert with LengthMismatch
    └── given the commands and inputs lengths match
        ├── when the deadline has passed
        │   └── it should revert with Expired
        └── given the deadline has not passed
            ├── given the batch is active
            │   ├── when an external caller reenters
            │   │   └── it should revert with ContractLocked
            │   ├── when the execution address reenters through a child frame
            │   │   ├── it should run the child commands without opening a new frame
            │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
            │   └── when a child frame command reads the logical sender
            │       ├── it should resolve _msgSender() to the outer caller
            │       └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
            └── given the batch is not active
                ├── when the command list is empty
                │   ├── it should not dispatch any command
                │   ├── it should emit BatchExecuted with _sender
                │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                ├── given the batch tracked a position
                │   ├── when a tracked position still belongs to the router at closure
                │   │   └── it should revert with NftNotCleared
                │   ├── when an in flight position is left unconsumed at closure
                │   │   └── it should revert with NftNotCleared
                │   ├── when a tracked position has left the router at closure
                │   │   ├── it should complete the batch
                │   │   └── it should clear the nft tracking
                │   ├── when a tracked position was burned before closure
                │   │   ├── it should complete the batch
                │   │   └── it should clear the nft tracking
                │   └── when the same position is tracked by a later batch in the same transaction
                │       ├── it should check the same position again at the later batch closure
                │       └── it should clear the nft tracking
                └── given the command list is not empty
                    ├── given a root only command runs on a leaf deployment
                    │   ├── when the root only command is create stake
                    │   │   └── it should revert with NotRoot for _commandType
                    │   └── when the root only command is deposit relay
                    │       └── it should revert with NotRoot for _commandType
                    ├── when the leaf only redeem command runs on a root deployment
                    │   └── it should revert with NotLeaf for _commandType
                    ├── given a command is unflagged
                    │   ├── when the command id is undefined above the defined range
                    │   │   └── it should revert the whole batch with InvalidCommandType for _commandType
                    │   ├── when the command id is undefined inside a command gap
                    │   │   └── it should revert the whole batch with InvalidCommandType for _commandType
                    │   └── when the command reverts
                    │       └── it should revert the whole batch and bubble the command failure
                    ├── when a flagged command reverts
                    │   ├── it should revert only the inner call
                    │   ├── it should continue the batch with the next command
                    │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                    ├── when a flagged command id is undefined
                    │   ├── it should swallow the InvalidCommandType revert and continue the batch
                    │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                    ├── when a flagged command succeeds
                    │   ├── it should persist its tracked token into the closure sweep
                    │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                    └── given the batch completes
                        ├── given the batch tracked tokens
                        │   ├── when a tracked token holds a balance
                        │   │   ├── it should return that _token balance to _sender
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   ├── when a tracked token holds no balance
                        │   │   ├── it should not transfer that _token
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   ├── when the same token is tracked by a later batch in the same transaction
                        │   │   ├── it should sweep that _token again at the later batch closure
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   ├── when a tracked native mirror token holds more than the pre batch native
                        │   │   ├── it should not transfer the token through its entry point
                        │   │   ├── it should refund the batch portion through the native refund
                        │   │   ├── it should keep the pre batch native in the router
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   └── when a tracked native mirror token holds only the pre batch native
                        │       ├── it should not transfer the token through its entry point
                        │       ├── it should keep the pre batch native in the router
                        │       └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        ├── given the native balance is not spent
                        │   ├── when native eth was introduced
                        │   │   ├── it should refund _nativeRefund to _sender
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   ├── when the refund recipient returns native eth
                        │   │   ├── it should revert with NativeBalanceNotCleared
                        │   │   └── it should leave no residual native eth
                        │   ├── when a position arrives while the refund is sent
                        │   │   └── it should revert with NativeTransferFailed wrapping UnexpectedNftSender
                        │   ├── when the native refund fails
                        │   │   └── it should revert with NativeTransferFailed with _data
                        │   ├── when the native refund fails on a mirror deployment
                        │   │   └── it should deliver the refund through the mirror entry point
                        │   ├── when the mirror transfer delivers the rejected refund
                        │   │   ├── it should close the batch with no native left behind
                        │   │   └── it should credit the refund through the mirror entry point
                        │   ├── when the native refund fails on a lower decimals mirror deployment
                        │   │   └── it should deliver the refund floored to the mirror decimals
                        │   ├── when the mirror transfer delivers a floored refund on a lower decimals deployment
                        │   │   ├── it should close the batch leaving the untransferable remainder
                        │   │   └── it should credit the floored refund through the mirror entry point
                        │   ├── when the failed refund is below one raw mirror unit
                        │   │   ├── it should skip the mirror transfer
                        │   │   ├── it should close the batch leaving the untransferable remainder
                        │   │   └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        │   ├── when the mirror fallback transfer fails
                        │   │   └── it should revert with NativeTransferFailed with the native data
                        │   └── when no native eth was introduced
                        │       ├── it should not refund _sender
                        │       └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
                        └── when the outer frame settles
                            ├── it should emit BatchExecuted with _sender
                            └── it should clear the transient execution slots at closure
